# Factory arguments (live)

Same assemblage as `examples/factory_args.wcn`. Target is `%canvas`.

A free name in an `@` slot is a factory parameter. Target builds the borrowed
`Pen` with `new Pen("blue")` and passes it into `SketchAssemblage.factory(pen)`.

## Schema

```
Pen = String/ink
Sketch = String/name @Pen
```

## Construction

```
[:Sketch "star" pen]
```

## Methods

```
Sketch::caption = { name.concat(" ").concat(pen.ink) }
```

## Target

```
%canvas

%requires
Pen

%init
var sketch;
var palette;

function init() {
    var pen = new Pen("blue");
    sketch = SketchAssemblage.factory(pen);
    palette = {blue: 0x3b82f6, red: 0xef4444, gold: 0xfbbf24};
}

%step
function step() {
    var ink = sketch.pen.ink;
    var color = palette[ink];
    if (!color) {
        color = 0x94a3b8;
    }
    wchntGraphics.clear();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0x1a1a2e);
    wchntGraphics.drawRect(0, 0, 800, 600);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(color);
    wchntGraphics.drawCircle(400, 280, 90);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
    wchntGraphics.beginFill(0xf8fafc);
    wchntGraphics.fillText(sketch.caption(), 330, 430);
    wchntGraphics.endFill();
}
```
